    "text": "The internal energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>U</mi></mfenced></math>, pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>P</mi></mfenced></math> and volume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>V</mi></mfenced></math> of an ideal gas are related as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The gas is",
